title: Files, Search, Source control and Extensions are tabs of the left dock: each takes the place of the other
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left search
wait 800
mark a-search
wait 400
left extensions
wait 1200
mark b-extensions
wait 400
left changes
wait 800
mark c-changes
wait 400
left files
wait 800
mark d-files
wait 400
quit
